{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは、渡辺です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニュースです。事件が起こりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"携帯の画面が割れました\n今まで何度も落としていたのに\n全然割れたことがなかった携帯さん\nついに、割れました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心が折れました......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上、最近の出来事でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この間は東京ビッグサイトにて\n握手会がありました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4部 巫女さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/05/18/3409390/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は少し前髪を分けてみました\nどうでしょうか〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5部"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/05/18/3409390/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ソイ！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ワンピース:Ank Rouge"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/05/18/3409390/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"抱き合っています鈴木絢音と"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"水色のワンピース着ています"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"背伸びしているのは気にしないでください"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう一度言います"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"背伸びしているのは気にしないでください"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/05/18/3409390/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お花も頂きました。\nありがとうございます(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じょしらくに\n未央奈、生田さん、一実さん、まなったんが\n観に来てくださいました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑い声がたくさん聞こえてきて\nやっている私たちもすごくやりがいが\nあって嬉しくなりました(^ ^)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日友達からメディアで\nじょしらくの記者会見見たよ！\nと興奮気味に電話があり\n嬉しい反面、\n今日三公演目突入で\n毎回噛むんではないかとか\n不安との戦いでご飯も喉に\nとうりません←食べてますけどね(^-^)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただね、、味が分からないんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！あとね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回のブログで、どこで盛り上ったらいいの？と言う質問がありました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非とも曲が流れる所は\n一緒に弾けましょう(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆でせい〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3チームそれぞれが\nこのじょしらくの楽しさを\n味わってもらえるよう\nみんな頑張っているので\n宜しくお願い致します♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じょしらくあと3公演\n頑張っていきます〜！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/05/18/3409390/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みりあんさーとみりターンは\n今回はおやすみします(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また見てね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みり愛"}],"source":"archive"}